w=80 h=24
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|Hardware & artificial cursors — per-widget shape, blink, color and custom glyphs|
|                                                                                |
|      Styled shapes use the terminal's hardware cursor when it can comply;      |
|       otherwise Crysterm composites an artificial cursor into the cells.       |
|                                                                                |
|              ┌─ set_cursor :block, blink: true ─────────────────┐              |
|              │A blinking block cursor                           │              |
|              └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘              |
|                                                                                |
|              ┌─ :underline + cursor_color ──────────────────────┐              |
|              │An orange underline cursor                        │              |
|              └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘              |
|                                                                                |
|              ┌─ :line + cursor_color ───────────────────────────┐              |
|              │A cyan bar cursor                                 │              |
|              └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘              |
|                                                                                |
|              ┌─ :none — custom artificial glyph ────────────────┐              |
|              │A custom-glyph artificial cursor▚                 │              |
|              └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘              |
|                                                                                |
|   Focus (and with it the active cursor) moves to the next field every 1.2 s    |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                                |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
